{"id":25,"text":"A hare was very fast. He always laughed at a slow tortoise. “You are so slow!” he said.\n\nThe tortoise smiled. “Let’s have a race,” he said.\n\nThe hare laughed. “Okay!”\n\nAll the animals came to watch. The race began. The hare ran very fast and soon he could not see the tortoise.\n\n“This is easy,” said the hare. “I can sleep now.” He lay under a tree and closed his eyes.\n\nThe tortoise did not stop. He walked slowly, step by step. He walked and walked.\n\nThe sun went down. The tortoise passed the sleeping hare. He kept going.\n\nFinally, the hare woke up. He looked around. “Where is the tortoise?” he asked. Then he saw him near the end of the road!\n\nThe hare ran as fast as he could, but it was too late. The tortoise crossed the line first.\n\nAll the animals shouted, “The tortoise wins!”\n\nThe hare felt ashamed. He said, “You are slow, but you never stopped.”\n\nMoral: Slow and steady wins the race.","tr":null,"gl":{"a":"bir (noaniq artikl)","hare":"quyon","was":"edi","very":"juda","fast":"tez","he":"u (erkak)","always":"doim, har doim","laughed":"kuldi","at":"-da, -ga","slow":"sekin","tortoise":"toshbaqa","you":"sen, siz","are":"-dir, -siz, -lar (to be)","so":"shuning uchun; shunday","said":"dedi","the":"(aniq artikl)","smiled":"jilmaydi","let":"ruxsat bermoq; qani, ...aylik","have":"ega bo'lmoq; bor","race":"poyga","okay":"mayli, yaxshi","all":"hamma, barcha","animals":"hayvonlar","came":"keldi","to":"-ga; uchun","watch":"kuzatmoq","began":"boshladi","ran":"yugurdi","and":"va","soon":"tez orada","could":"qila olardi","not":"emas","see":"ko'rmoq","this":"bu","is":"-dir (to be)","easy":"oson","i":"men","can":"qila olmoq","sleep":"uxlamoq","now":"hozir, endi","lay":"joylashgan edi, yotardi","under":"ostida","tree":"daraxt","closed":"yopdi, yopiq","his":"uning","eyes":"ko'zlar","did":"qildi","stop":"to'xtatmoq","walked":"yurdi","slowly":"sekin-asta","step":"qadam","by":"tomonidan, yonida, orqali","sun":"quyosh","went":"bordi, ketdi","down":"p